            <div class="project-head">
              <div class="project-title">Lists</div>
              <div class="project-meta">
                <span class="project-year">2017</span>
                <span class="json-btn" data-modal="#code-example-list">API</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <%= render_modal "code-example-list", "Lists" do %>
              <p class="italics">This is an authenticated resource, so all requests made must include basic authentication, using your `username:password`, base64 encoded and passed along in the Authorization Header.</p>
              <p>`Authorization: Basic dXNlcm5hbWU6cGFzc3dvcmQ=`</p>
              <p>`curl` will automatically encode your username and password when passed with the `-u` option.</p>
              <hr>
              <p>The List API currently allows for requesting all lists belonging to the authenticated user, or a specific list. Lists can also be modified using an English-like string.</p>
              <h3>GET Index</h3>
              <%= raw pretty(:bash, "requests/lists/index.json") %>
              <%= raw pretty(:js, "response/lists/index.json") %>
              <h3>GET Show</h3>
              <%= raw pretty(:bash, "requests/lists/show.json") %>
              <%= raw pretty(:js, "response/lists/show.json") %>
              <h3>POST Update</h3>
              <p>Multiple items can be included in the same request by splitting names with commas.</p>
              <p>`add &lt;list of item names&gt;` is used for adding items to the list - does not return an error if one or more items already exist on the list.</p>
              <p>`remove &lt;list of item names&gt;` is used for removing items from the list - does not return an error if one or more items are not found.</p>
              <p>`clear` is used for removing all items from the list.</p>
              <%= raw pretty(:bash, "requests/lists/update.json") %>
              <%= raw pretty(:js, "response/lists/update.json") %>
            <% end %>
            <div class="project-description">
              To-do and grocery lists that sync live across every device and everyone you share them with.
            </div>
          </a>

